WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.720
There are a bunch of hidden features in
the ps5 that Sony hasn't really shouted

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.839
about just yet so we're going to run you
through nine of them

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:11.519
let's go. Profiles have been revamped on
PS5.

00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:15.040
On the overview page you get a quick
look at everything going on with that

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.359
person's PS5 profile
including a look at the new accolades. If

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:22.320
you're familiar with the endorsement
system in overwatch

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:26.160
these might look familiar. They're there
to encourage a positive Playstation

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.960
community and you can give one accolade
per match

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.079
when playing online. The PS5 also finally
shows you how many hours you've played a

00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:36.960
certain game for
and unlike the Switch which waits a few

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:41.040
days before it gives you that figure,
it shows you right away. This is also

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.200
retroactive for PS4 games.
Profiles also have a tab that collates

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.520
every screenshot or video you've ever
shared via your linked social networks

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.879
so if you want to revisit that play of
the game that really popped off it's

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:55.600
right there for you.
If you're fed up of having to invert

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.359
controls or change difficulty settings
each time you boot up a game

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:03.199
the PS5 now has a system wide solve for
that. In settings &gt;

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:06.400
save data and game app settings &gt; game
presets

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.840
you can choose your preferred difficulty
level whether you play in performance

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.439
mode or resolution mode,
whether you invert your camera or not,

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:17.040
and your subtitle preference.
Right now this only works with games

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:20.159
that support this feature but it's very
cool nonetheless.

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:23.840
You might notice that the dual sense
controller has a nice grip.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:27.680
Look closely and you'll see that it's
actually made up of tiny PlayStation

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:30.400
symbols.
But that's not the only place you can

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.600
see them. Look on the inside of the
console's faceplates.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:37.119
If you tap the PlayStation button to
bring up the control center then tap the

00:01:37.119 --> 00:01:40.000
options button, you'll be able to
customize what appears

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.600
on the bar, meaning you can quickly pin
things like accessibility,

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:48.479
broadcast network, and music options. If
you want to reserve your internal PS5

00:01:48.479 --> 00:01:52.159
storage for PS5 games
you can set the console to always put

00:01:52.159 --> 00:01:55.920
your PS4 games
on extended storage. If this isn't

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.560
enabled
you can't choose where a game gets

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.520
installed when you start installing it.
You also can't install PS5 games or move

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:07.840
them onto an external hard drive,
just FYI. You can change your privacy

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.879
options way more easily on the PS5 as
there are now

00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:14.800
a number of various privacy profiles
that limit what you share publicly.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.480
There's a privacy profile that opens
everything up meaning pretty much

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.480
everything you do can be visible to
others,

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.680
privacy profiles that keep your activity
friend focused,

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:27.680
and there's one that hides everything
you're up to. You can now favorite screen

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.920
grabs or video clips which makes them
show up

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.920
in a different tab when browsing the
media gallery. Screen grabs when trophies

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.319
are earned look
different with a new border that shows

00:02:36.319 --> 00:02:41.519
the name of the trophy and its rarity.
By default, the PS5 captures a 14 or 15

00:02:41.519 --> 00:02:45.599
second long video each time you earn a
trophy which you may want to turn off if

00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:49.599
you're interested in saving space.
The PS5 game library has seen some

00:02:49.599 --> 00:02:53.040
changes to ease navigation.
For starters you can now quickly filter

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:58.319
by platform so you can see all your ps3,
4, or 5 games in one spot. It's also now

00:02:58.319 --> 00:03:01.519
much easier to see where you got a
particular game from

00:03:01.519 --> 00:03:05.120
whether it's the PlayStation store, PS
Plus or PS Now.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.879
You can also see at a glance where you
have each game installed which is

00:03:08.879 --> 00:03:12.800
particularly useful if you use
external storage a lot. You can also use

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:17.680
the game library to quickly access demos
or PS4 versions of PS5 games you have

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.360
attached to your account.
The PlayStation 5 has a few more

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.000
accessibility options than the
PlayStation 4.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.680
When you first boot up the console, the
screen reader is on by default in its

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.599
setup:
"speech speed normal." You can also set up

00:03:31.599 --> 00:03:33.920
the console to convert voice chat to
text

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.519
and even to read your written chat
messages to other players. When using the

00:03:37.519 --> 00:03:42.720
PS5 keyboard to input text
tap R1 to autocomplete. You can also hit

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.840
L3
to use emojis.

00:03:48.319 --> 00:03:51.840
So there we are, 9 hidden things you
didn't know your PlayStation 5 could do.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:04:01.840
For more on Sony's brand new console,
keep it GameSpot.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:11.840
 

